#: ../../source/users/project/what_is.rst:5
msgid "What is a project?"
msgstr "什么是项目？"

#: ../../source/users/project/what_is.rst:7
msgid ""
"The term project inside QElectroTech can be assimilated to a \"database\". A"
" project is not a common database, it is a collection of information which "
"is not structured in columns and rows."
msgstr "QElectroTech 中的“项目”一词可以理解为一个“数据库”。项目并非常规意义上的数据库，而是一组不以行列结构组织的信息集合。"

#: ../../source/users/project/what_is.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech project structure"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目结构"

#: ../../source/users/project/what_is.rst:15
msgid ""
"A project is a group of `folios`_, `elements`_ and `conductors`_ represented"
" inside the `folios`_ with the respective properties, properties which "
"define the way how should be represented each folio (`title block`_, "
"dimensions, etc.), properties which define how the reports should be "
"represented (folio index, component list, connector list, etc.), properties "
"which define how to export or print the information, interconnection "
"relation between `elements`_ from the same or different `folios`_ and the "
"master data (project name, author, year of creation, revision, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"一个项目由一组 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 组成，这些 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 中包含 `元件 <elements_>`_ 和 `导体 "
"<conductors_>`_ 及其各自的属性；属性定义了每个图幅的呈现方式（ `图框 <title block_>`_ "
"、尺寸等），定义了报表的呈现方式（图幅索引、元件列表、连接器列表等），定义了如何导出或打印信息，定义了同一或不同 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 中 "
"`元件 <elements_>`_ 之间的互连关系，以及主数据（项目名称、作者、创建年份、修订版本等）。"

#: ../../source/users/project/what_is.rst:22
msgid ""
"The project is the base of QElectroTech to manage a work. The development "
"team has focus the tasks on the electrical and control filed, even so, "
"QElectroTech is a E-CAE software. For this reason, QElectroTech is an inter-"
"disciplinary tool that allows the user to create many type of projects."
msgstr ""
"项目是 QElectroTech 管理工作的基础。开发团队将重点放在电气与控制领域，尽管如此，QElectroTech 仍是一款 E-CAE "
"软件。因此，QElectroTech 是一款跨学科工具，允许用户创建多种类型的项目。"

#: ../../source/users/project/what_is.rst:26
msgid "Electrical projects: Purely electrical systems"
msgstr "电气项目：纯电气系统"

#: ../../source/users/project/what_is.rst:27
msgid "Automation projects: GRAFCET, diagrams, etc."
msgstr "自动化项目：GRAFCET、图表等。"

#: ../../source/users/project/what_is.rst:28
msgid ""
"Fluid power projects: Hydraulic, pneumatic and central lubrication systems"
msgstr "流体动力项目：液压、气动和集中润滑系统"

#: ../../source/users/project/what_is.rst:29
msgid "Process control projects: Process Industrial Diagrams (PID)"
msgstr "过程控制项目：工艺工业图（PID）"
